  "rules": [
    "Store numerical value and unit separately; never silently assume a unit.",
    "Use absolute temperature in thermodynamic equations unless the formula explicitly states otherwise.",
    "Distinguish mass concentration, amount concentration, activity and dimensionless ratios.",
    "Preserve original units and record every conversion in provenance.",
    "Dimensionally consistent equations can still be scientifically wrong."
  ]
